cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper."
title: "SOTA: Strategy-level reinforcement learning for options portfolio management"
abstract: >-
  Code release for a language-model post-training framework for option strategy
  selection guided by option-implied return distributions. The policy emits
  strategy intent in a small domain-specific language; deterministic resolvers
  map intent to contracts, positions and hedge trades; the reward is realized
  after-cost portfolio return.
authors:
